<p>b) General Fertility Rate \(\displaystyle \frac{\text {number of live births}}{ \text{number of women age}     {@age_group1@}-{@age_group8@}} \times 1000=\frac{{@total_fem_birth@}}{{@total_fem_pop*100@}} \times 1000={@ta1@}\)</p>

<p>c)</p> 
