  <p>Total Fertility Rate \( =\displaystyle \frac {\sum ASFR}{1000} =\frac{{@gg@}}{1000}={@ta2@}\)
  <p>d) GRR \(= \frac{\text{Number of female births}}{\text{Total births}} \times \text{Total Fertility Rate} =\displaystyle \frac{{@num_female_birth@}}{{@total_fem_birth@}} \times {@ta2@} ={@ta3@}\)</p>]]></text>
